    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a rogue, you gain the following class features.</p><h2>Hit Points</h2><p><strong>Hit Dice:</strong> 1d8 per rogue level</p><p><strong>Hit Points at 1st Level:</strong> 8 + your Constitution modifier</p><p><strong>Hit Points at Higher Levels:</strong> 1d8 (or 5) + your Constitution modifier per rogue level after 1st</p><h2>Proficiencies</h2><p><strong>Armor:</strong> Light armor</p><p><strong>Weapons:</strong> Simple weapons, hand crossbows, longswords, rapiers, shortswords</p><p><strong>Tools:</strong> Thieves' tools</p><p><strong>Saving Throws:</strong> Dexterity, Intelligence</p><p><strong>Skills:</strong> Choose four from Acrobatics, Athletics, Deception, Insight, Intimidation, Investigation, Perception, Performance, Persuasion, Sleight of Hand, and Stealth</p><h2>Equipment</h2><p>You start with the following equipment, in addition to the equipment granted by your background:</p><ul><li><p>(a) a rapier or (b) a shortsword</p></li><li><p>(a) a shortbow and quiver of 20 arrows or (b) a shortsword</p></li><li><p>(a) a burglar's pack or (b) a dungeoneer's pack, or (c) an explorer's pack</p></li><li><p>Leather armor, two daggers, and thieves' tools</p></li></ul><h2>Class Table</h2><table><tbody><tr><td data-colwidth=\"44\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Level</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"71\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Proficiency Bonus</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"53\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Energy Points</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"73\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Sneak Attack Dice</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Features</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"44\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">1st</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"71\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">2</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"53\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">X</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"73\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">1d6</p></td><td><p>Expertise, @UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.class-features.Item.Yh7akRCw716Uv5Ih]{Sneak Attack}, @UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.class-features.Item.mXuVPY1JHrXlhVZ3]{Secret Missives}</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"44\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">2nd</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"71\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">2</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"53\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">1</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"73\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">1d6</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.class-features.Item.CatURKZcPWpj09Sr]{Energy}, @UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.class-features.Item.ye8vnlekSJFMuJde]{Cunning Action}</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"44\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">3rd</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"71\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">2</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"53\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">2</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"73\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">2d6</p></td><td><p>Roguish Archetype</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"44\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">4th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"71\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">2</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"53\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">2</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"73\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">2d6</p></td><td><p>ASI</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"44\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">5th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"71\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">3</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"53\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">3</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"73\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">3d6</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.classfeatures.Item.Mm64SKAHJWYecgXS]{Uncanny Dodge}</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"44\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">6th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"71\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">3</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"53\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">3</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"73\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">3d6</p></td><td><p>Expertise</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"44\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">7th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"71\">